{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3364810/extras/Description-Image.png?t=1743568280\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Don\u2019t Shoot the Humans!</strong> is a  horror-detective game that immerses you in a tense first-person journey of life-or-death decisions. <br><br>Armed with only a single firearm and your instincts, you\u2019ll encounter eerie, humanoid figures shrouded in darkness. Each figure presents an impossible choice: shoot or save.    <br> <br>If you mistakenly shoot a human or spare a non-human, the consequences are deathly and the game is over.  <br> <br><strong>Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">psychological horror</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Atmospheric environment\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Tense Life and death decisions</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Investigative game play\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Hidden clues and secrets</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Non-linear storytelling<br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3364810/extras/LibraryHeader.png?t=1743568280\" /></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Don\u2019t Shoot the Humans!</strong> delivers a tense, atmospheric blend of moral dilemma, investigative gameplay, and psychological horror. Can you decide friend from foe or will one wrong choice doom you to a fate worse than death? Every shot counts.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3364810?t=1743568280","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3364810?t=1743568280","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3364810/a9416844a806bec14fd4465e2e494acf5071600b/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1743568280","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.s